[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the front hub (1a) from the steering knuckle (1b) using\na press (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046793.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Position the front wheel hub in a vice.</p><p>2. Move the bearing inner race away from the hub, using a chisel,\nto allow the extractor arms to be fitted.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>When carrying out this operation,\ntake the utmost care not to damage the front wheel hub.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046794.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the front hub bearing inner race using the tool (1a) fitted\nwith components (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.003</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.002</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Pad</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.845.028.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046795.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Place the front hub in a vice.</p><p>2. Remove the front hub bearing circlip.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046796.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the front hub bearing from the steering knuckle (1a) using\na press (1b) and the tool (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Puller/ftitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.874.552.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046797.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the intenal surfaces\nof the front steering knuckle do not show seizure marks and that\nthe arms have not been struck or are showing signs of breakage. If\nthey do, replace the steering knuckle.</p><p>1. Fit front hub bearing (1a) onto the strut using hydraulic press\n(1b) and fitting tool (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Puller/ftitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.874.552.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046798.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. If a hydraulic press is not available, insert bearing (1a) using\ntools (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Puller/ftitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.874.552.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Grip</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.007.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046799.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Fit  the front hub bearing\ncirclip.</p><p>1. Place the steering knuckle in the press and rest it on the tools.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Half-plate</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.837.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Fit the front wheel hub on the steering knuckle (2a) using a\npress (2b) and placing the tool (2c) in between.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Puller/ftitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.874.552.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046800.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]